begin="10.226" end="10.915">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是希望——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore wa kibō—</span></p><p begin="11.210" end="14.217" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.210" end="11.394">或</span><span begin="11.394" end="11.520">い</span><span begin="11.520" end="11.827">は</span><span begin="11.827" end="11.971">、</span><span begin="11.971" end="12.295">呪</span><span begin="12.295" end="12.562">い</span><span begin="12.562" end="12.919">の</span><span begin="12.919" end="13.622">類</span><span begin="13.622" end="13.995">か</span><span begin="13.995" end="14.217">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">亦或是，诅咒之类？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Arui wa, noroi no tagui ka?</span></p><p begin="14.039" end="16.363" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.039" end="14.358">あ</span><span begin="14.358" end="15.430">あ</span> <span begin="15.430" end="15.750">夜</span><span begin="15.750" end="16.363">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，在那夜里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, yoru ni</span></p><p begin="16.732" end="19.413" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.732" end="17.125">空</span><span begin="17.125" end="17.619">高</span><span begin="17.619" end="17.799">く</span><span begin="17.799" end="18.153">見</span><span begin="18.153" end="18.284">上</span><span begin="18.284" end="18.448">げ</span><span begin="18.448" end="18.817">た</span><span begin="18.817" end="19.016">の</span><span begin="19.016" end="19.147">な</span><span begin="19.147" end="19.413">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若仰望高远的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora takaku miageta no nara</span></p><p begin="19.566" end="21.215" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.566" end="19.730">そ</span><span begin="19.730" end="19.895">こ</span><span begin="19.895" end="20.793">に</span><span begin="20.793" end="21.016">は</span><span begin="21.016" end="21.215">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那里——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soko ni wa—</span></p><p begin="21.585" end="24.572" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.585" end="21.871">い</span><span begin="21.871" end="22.157">つ</span><span begin="22.157" end="22.516">か</span><span begin="22.516" end="22.676">の</span> <span begin="22.676" end="23.136">星</span><span begin="23.136" end="23.699">が</span><span begin="23.699" end="24.125">—</span><span begin="24.125" end="24.572">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有那曾经的星——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka no hoshi ga——</span></p><p begin="36.794" end="41.279" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.794" end="38.094">已</span><span begin="38.094" end="38.831">の</span><span begin="38.831" end="39.500">運</span><span begin="39.500" end="40.203">命</span><span begin="40.203" end="40.838">こ</span><span begin="40.838" end="41.279">そ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">自身的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onore no unmei koso</span></p><p begin="41.554" end="46.456" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.554" end="42.989">己</span><span begin="42.989" end="43.624">の</span><span begin="43.624" end="44.308">も</span><span begin="44.308" end="44.769">の</span><span begin="44.769" end="45.040">だ</span><span begin="45.040" end="46.456">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">本属于自己的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onore no mono da to</span></p><p begin="47.125" end="49.942" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.125" end="47.479">み</span><span begin="47.479" end="47.872">な</span><span begin="47.872" end="48.560">言</span><span begin="48.560" end="48.880">う</span><span begin="48.880" end="49.234">の</span><span begin="49.234" end="49.942">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">众人如是说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mina iu no wa</span></p><p begin="50.255" end="52.007" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.255" end="50.575">容</span><span begin="50.575" end="50.876">易</span><span begin="50.876" end="51.249">き</span><span begin="51.249" end="51.588">こ</span><span begin="51.588" end="52.007">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">何其容易</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tayasuki koto</span></p><p begin="53.175" end="57.708" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.175" end="53.393">言</span><span begin="53.393" end="54.029">葉</span><span begin="54.029" end="54.435">の</span><span begin="54.435" end="55.448">上</span><span begin="55.448" end="56.137">な</span><span begin="56.137" end="57.708">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若只在言语之上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba no ue nara</span></p><p begin="58.919" end="1:03.282" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.919" end="59.661">け</span><span begin="59.661" end="59.948">れ</span><span begin="59.948" end="1:00.291">ど</span><span begin="1:00.291" end="1:00.994">己</span><span begin="1:00.994" end="1:01.381">の</span><span begin="1:01.381" end="1:03.045">持</span><span begin="1:03.045" end="1:03.282">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然而自己手中的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Keredo onore no motsu</span></p><p begin="1:03.792" end="1:08.594" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.792" end="1:04.131">そ</span><span begin="1:04.131" end="1:04.466">の</span><span begin="1:04.466" end="1:05.098">運</span><span begin="1:05.098" end="1:06.514">命</span><span begin="1:06.514" end="1:06.833">は</span><span begin="1:06.833" end="1:07.193">ま</span><span begin="1:07.193" end="1:08.594">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那命运亦会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono unmei wa mata</span></p><p begin="1:09.312" end="1:12.402" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.312" end="1:09.652">と</span><span begin="1:09.652" end="1:10.006">き</span><span begin="1:10.006" end="1:10.725">に</span><span begin="1:10.725" end="1:11.307">容</span><span begin="1:11.307" end="1:12.044">易</span><span begin=