1:27.669" end="1:28.001">に</span><span begin="1:28.001" end="1:28.482">塗</span><span begin="1:28.482" end="1:28.733">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">满身泥污</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doro ni mamire</span></p><p begin="1:28.995" end="1:31.526" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.995" end="1:29.368">薄</span><span begin="1:29.368" end="1:29.829">汚</span><span begin="1:29.829" end="1:30.396">れ</span><span begin="1:30.396" end="1:30.750">た</span><span begin="1:30.750" end="1:31.526">姿</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">微染尘污的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Usuyogoreta sugata</span></p><p begin="1:32.224" end="1:36.932" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.224" end="1:32.893">だ</span><span begin="1:32.893" end="1:33.261">け</span><span begin="1:33.261" end="1:33.387">れ</span><span begin="1:33.387" end="1:34.621">ど</span> <span begin="1:34.621" end="1:34.959">そ</span><span begin="1:34.959" end="1:35.441">の</span><span begin="1:35.441" end="1:36.004">ど</span><span begin="1:36.004" end="1:36.344">れ</span><span begin="1:36.344" end="1:36.712">よ</span><span begin="1:36.712" end="1:36.858">り</span><span begin="1:36.858" end="1:36.932">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然而，比那一切更甚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakeredo, sono dore yori mo</span></p><p begin="1:37.259" end="1:39.694" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.259" end="1:37.531">一</span><span begin="1:37.531" end="1:38.738">番</span><span begin="1:38.738" end="1:38.937">痛</span><span begin="1:38.937" end="1:39.694">み</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">最为痛楚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ichiban itami</span></p><p begin="1:40.036" end="1:42.725" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.036" end="1:40.113">傷</span><span begin="1:40.113" end="1:40.297">付</span><span begin="1:40.297" end="1:40.632">い</span><span begin="1:40.632" end="1:40.797">て</span><span begin="1:40.797" end="1:40.957">い</span><span begin="1:40.957" end="1:41.194">る</span><span begin="1:41.194" end="1:41.678">の</span><span begin="1:41.678" end="1:42.066">は</span><span begin="1:42.066" end="1:42.439">—</span><span begin="1:42.439" end="1:42.725">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">受伤最深的是——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kizutsuite iru no wa——</span></p><p begin="1:43.032" end="1:45.607" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.032" end="1:43.178">行</span><span begin="1:43.178" end="1:43.328">先</span><span begin="1:43.328" end="1:43.682">無</span><span begin="1:43.682" end="1:44.371">き</span><span begin="1:44.371" end="1:44.705">鳴</span><span begin="1:44.705" end="1:45.132">咽</span><span begin="1:45.132" end="1:45.607">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无处可去的哽咽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yukisaki naki koe wo</span></p><p begin="1:45.687" end="1:47.958" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.687" end="1:45.759">そ</span><span begin="1:45.759" end="1:46.036">の</span><span begin="1:46.036" end="1:47.088">淚</span><span begin="1:47.088" end="1:47.301">の</span><span begin="1:47.301" end="1:47.481">わ</span><span begin="1:47.481" end="1:47.942">け</span><span begin="1:47.942" end="1:47.958">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那泪水的缘由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono namida no wake wo</span></p><p begin="1:48.512" end="1:51.014" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.512" end="1:48.870">途</span><span begin="1:48.870" end="1:49.326">方</span><span begin="1:49.326" end="1:49.773">に</span> <span begin="1:49.773" end="1:49.900">暮</span><span begin="1:49.900" end="1:50.050">れ</span><span begin="1:50.050" end="1:50.282">る</span><span begin="1:50.282" end="1:50.811">ほ</span><span begin="1:50.811" end="1:50.937">ど</span><span begin="1:50.937" end="1:51.014">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">茫然无措至极</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tohō ni kureru hodo ni</span></p><p begin="1:51.280" end="1:54.297" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.280" end="1:51.426">自</span><span begin="1:51.426" end="1:52.048">分</span><span begin="1:52.048" end="1:52.193">に</span><span begin="1:52.193" end="1:52.493">さ</span><span begin="1:52.493" end="1:52.632">え</span> <span begin="1:52.632" end="1:53.005">わ</span><span begin="1:53.005" end="1:53.359">か</span><span begin="1:53.359" end="1:53.713">ら</span><span begin="1:53.713" end="1:54.025">な</span><span begin="1:54.025" end="1:54.297">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连自己都无法明了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Jibun ni sae wakaranai</span></p><p begin="1:54.374" end="1:56.522" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.374" end="1:54.906">ど</span><span begin="1:54.906" end="1:55.314">れ</span><span begin="1:55.314" end="1:55.439">ほ</span><span begin="1:55.439" end="1:55.585">ど</span><span begin="1:55.585" end="1:55.750">の</span><span begin="1:55.750" end="1:56.522">数</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">不知多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dore hodo no kazu</span></p><p begin="1:56.820" end="1:59.143" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.820" end="1:57.241">描</span><span begin="1:57.241" end="1:57.566">い</span><span begin="1:57.566" end="1:58.033">た</span><span begin="1:58.033" end="1:58.488">物</span><span begin="1:58.488" end="1:59.143">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">描绘过的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Egaita monogatari</span></p><p begin="1:59.563" end="2:02.063" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.563" end="1:59.675">そ</span><span begin="1:59.675" end="1:59.941">の</span><span begin="1:59.941" end="2:00.382">す</span><span begin="2:00.382" end="2:00.678">べ</span><span begin="2:00.678" end="2:00.964">て</span><span begin="2:00.964" end="2:01.229">が</span><span begin="2:01.229" end="2:01.709">一</span><span begin="2:01.709" end="2:02.063">切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那一切的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono subete ga issai</span></p><p begin="2:02.373" end="2:06.284" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.373" end="2:02.678">叶</span><span begin="2:02.678" end="2:03.280">わ</span><span begin="2:03.280" end="2:03.774">ぬ</span><span begin="2:03.774" end="2:03.900">夢</span><span begin="2:03.900" end="2:04.292">想</span><span begin="2:04.292" end="2:04.607">と</span><span begin="2:04.607" end="2:04.777">知</span><span begin="2:04.777" end="2:05.029">っ</span><span begin="2:05.029" end="2:05.281">た</span><span begin="2:05.281" end="2:05.480">と</span><span begin="2:05.480" end="2:05.800">き</span><span begin="2:05.800" end="2:06.047">…</span><span begin="2:06.047" end="2:06.284">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当得知尽是无法企及的梦时……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kanawanu yume to shitta toki……</span></p><p begin="2:05.555" end="2:10.663" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:05.555" end="2:05.700">あ</span><span begin="2:05.700" end="2:05.879">あ</span><span begin="2:05.879" end="2:06.427">、</span><span begin="2:06.427" end="2:06.592">い</span><span begin="2:06.592" end="2:06.752">つ</span><span begin="2:06.752" end="2:07.754">か</span><span begin="2:07.754" end="2:07.885">見</span><span begin="2:07.885" end="2:08.011">た</span><span begin="2:08.011" end="2:08.620">あ</span><span begin="2:08.620" end="2:08.993">の</span><span begin="2:08.993" end="2:09.490">星</span><span begin="2:09.490" end="2:09.959">よ</span><span begin="2:09.959" end="2:10.304">—</span><span begin="2:10.304" end="2:10.663">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，那曾经仰望的星啊——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, itsuka mita ano hoshi yo——</span></p><p begin="2:22.212" end="2:26.596" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.212" end="2:23.544">己</span><span begin="2:23.544" end="2:24.316">の</span><span begin="2:24.316" end="2:24.666">運</span><span begin="2:24.666" end="2:26.256">命</span><span begin="2:26.256" end="2:26.596">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被自己的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onore no unmei ni</span></p><p begin="2:27.003" end="2:31.820" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.003" end="2:27.670">裏</span><span begin="2:27.670" end="2:28.373">切</span><span begin="2:28.373" end="2:29.109">ら</span><span begin="2:29.109" end="2:29.818">れ</span><span begin="2:29.818" end="2:30.137">た</span><span begin="2:30.137" end="2:30.473">と</span><span begin="2:30.473" end="2:31.820">き</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所背叛之时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Uragirareta toki</span></p><p begin="2:32.543" end="2:35.288" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.543" end="2:32.877">こ</span><span begin="2:32.877" end="2:33.217">の</span><span begin="2:33.217" end="2:33.897">世</span><span begin="2:33.897" end="2:34.653">界</span><span begin="2:34.653" end="2:35.288">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这世界便</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kono sekai wa</span></p><p begin="2:35.696" end="2:38.066" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.696" end="2:36.373">罠</span><span begin="2:36.373" end="2:36.694">の</span><span begin="2:36.694" end="2:37.378">様</span><span begin="2:37.378" end="2:38.066">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如陷阱一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Wana no yō ni</span></p><p begin="2:38.454" end="2:42.985" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.454" end="2:38.808">お</span><span begin="2:38.808" end="2:39.491">前</span><span begin="2:39.491" end="2:39.868">を</span><span begin="2:39.868" end="2:40.149">呑</span><span begin="2:40.149" end="2:40.871">み</span><span begin="2:40.871" end="2:41.628">込</span><span begin="2:41.628" end="2:42.985">む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将你吞噬</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omae wo nomikomu</span></p><p begin="2:44.371" end="2:48.908" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.371" end="2:45.132">形</span><span begin="2:45.132" end="2:45.729">無</span><span begin="2:45.729" end="2:46.430">き</span><span begin="2:46.430" end="2:47.831">悪</span><span begin="2:47.831" end="2:48.500">意</span><span begin="2:48.500" end="2:48.908">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无形之恶意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Katachi naki akui no</span></p><p begin="2:49.242" end="2:54.076" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.242" end="2:49.548">そ</span><span begin="2:49.548" end="2:49.902">の</span><span begin="2:49.902" end="2:50.605">大</span><span begin="2:50.605" end="2:51.259">き</span><span begin="2:51.259" end="2:51.754">さ</span><span begin="2:51.754" end="2:52.287">た</span><span begin="2:52.287" end="2:52.622">る</span><span begin="2:52.622" end="2:54.076">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其浩大何如</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono ōkisa taru ya</span></p><p begin="2:54.769" end="2:59.993" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:54.769" end="2:56.170">戦</span><span begin="2:56.170" end="2:56.490">う</span><span begin="2:56.490" end="2:56.849">に</span><span begin="2:56.849" end="2:57.523">は</span><span begin="2:57.523" end="2:57.773">そ</span><span begin="2:57.773" end="2:58.200">う</span><span begin="2:58.200" end="2:58.567">あ</span><span begin="2:58.567" end="2:58.961">ま</span><span begin="2:58.961" end="2:59.315">り</span><span begin="2:59.315" end="2:59.620">に</span><span begin="2:59.620" end="2:59.993">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与之抗争实在太过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tatakau ni wa sō amari ni mo</span></p><p begin="3:00.309" end="3:05.177" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.309" end="3:00.628">ち</span><span begin="3:00.628" end="3:01.002">っ</span><span begin="3:01.002" end="3:01.705">ぽ</span><span begin="3:01.705" end="3:02.029">け</span><span begin="3:02.029" end="3:02.384">な</span><span begin="3:02.384" end="3:03.819">勇</span><span begin="3:03.819" end="3:04.803">姿</span><span begin="3:04.803" end="3:05.177">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">渺小的英姿…</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Chippoke na yūshi…</span></p><p begin="3:05.485" end="3:11.416" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:05.485" end="3:06.188">絶</span><span begin="3:06.188" end="3:07.204">望</span><span begin="3:07.204" end="3:07.543">の</span><span begin="3:07.543" end="3:08.562">淵</span> <span begin="3:08.562" end="3:09.282">立</span><span begin="3:09.282" end="3:09.777">た</span><span begin="3:09.777" end="3:10.359">さ</span><span begin="3:10.359" end="3:10.679">る</span><span begin="3:10.679" end="3:11.018">る</span><span begin="3:11.018" end="3:11.144">も</span><span begin="3:11.144" end="3:11.416">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">被迫伫立于绝望深渊之人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Zetsubō no fuchi tatasaruru mono</span></p><p begin="3:12.010" end="3:17.276" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:12.010" end="3:12.645">そ</span><span begin="3:12.645" end="3:13.120">こ</span><span begin="3:13.120" end="3:13.456">に</span><span begin="3:13.456" end="3:13.848">死</span><span begin="3:13.848" end="3:14.345">は</span> <span begin="3:14.345" end="3:14.510">甘</span><span begin="3:14.510" end="3:14.762">く</span><span begin="3:14.762" end="3:15.162">甘</span><span begin="3:15.162" end="3:15.366">く</span><span begin="3:15.366" end="3:15.893">忍</span><span begin="3:15.893" end="3:16.214">び</span><span begin="3:16.214" end="3:16.951">寄</span><span begin="3:16.951" end="3:17.276">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">死便在那里 甜蜜地、甜蜜地悄然逼近</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soko ni shi wa amaku amaku shinobiyoru</span></p><p begin="3:17.670" end="3:19.418" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:17.670" end="3:18.339">そ</span><span begin="3:18.339" end="3:18.662">う</span><span begin="3:18.662" end="3:18.807">だ</span><span begin="3:18.807" end="3:19.059">ろ</span><span begin="3:19.059" end="3:19.418">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没错吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sō darō</span></p><p begin="3:20.063" end="3:22.651" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.063" end="3:20.402">そ</span><span begin="3:20.402" end="3:20.848">ん</span><span begin="3:20.848" end="3:21.430">な</span><span begin="3:21.430" end="3:22.356">運</span><span begin="3:22.356" end="3:22.651">命</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那样的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sonna unmei</span></p><p begin="3:22.699" end="3:24.993" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.699" end="3:22.845">生</span><span begin="3:22.845" end="3:22.995">き</span><span begin="3:22.995" end="3:24.096">て</span><span begin="3:24.096" end="3:24.246">い</span><span begin="3:24.246" end="3:24.391">て</span><span begin="3:24.391" end="3:24.993">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">纵然活着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikite ite mo</span></p><p begin="3:25.443" end="3:28.026" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:25.443" end="3:25.608">ど</span><span begin="3:25.608" end="3:25.768">う</span><span begin="3:25.768" end="3:26.141">し</span><span begin="3:26.141" end="3:26.306">よ</span><span begin="3:26.306" end="3:26.607">う</span><span begin="3:26.607" end="3:26.806">も</span><span begin="3:26.806" end="3:27.050">な</span><span begin="3:27.050" end="3:27.195">い</span><span begin="3:27.195" end="3:27.488">と</span><span begin="3:27.488" end="3:27.707">—</span><span begin="3:27.707" end="3:28.026">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也无可奈何——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dō shiyō mo nai to——</span></p><p begin="3:28.384" end="3:30.756" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:28.384" end="3:28.563">い</span><span begin="3:28.563" end="3:28.728">く</span><span begin="3:28.728" end="3:29.222">つ</span><span begin="3:29.222" end="3:29.718">も</span><span begin="3:29.718" end="3:29.973">願</span><span begin="3:29.973" end="3:30.133">つ</span><span begin="3:30.133" end="3:30.544">て</span><span begin="3:30.544" end="3:30.756">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论祈愿多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikutsu mo negatte mo</span></p><p begin="3:31.056" end="3:33.597" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:31.056" end="3:31.255">い</span><span begin="3:31.255" end="3:31.488">く</span><span begin="3:31.488" end="3:31.880">つ</span><span begin="3:31.880" end="3:32.412">も</span><span begin="3:32.412" end="3:32.610">望</span><span begin="3:32.610" end="3:32.850">ん</span><span begin="3:32.850" end="3:33.276">で</span><span begin="3:33.276" end="3:33.597">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">无论渴望多少次</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ikutsu mo nozonde mo</span></p><p begin="3:33.931" end="3:36.565" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.931" end="3:34.315">全</span><span begin="3:34.315" end="3:34.791">て</span><span begin="3:34.791" end="3:35.164">が</span> <span begin="3:35.164" end="3:35.329">無</span><span begin="3:35.329" end="3:35.513">駄</span><span begin="3:35.513" end="3:35.726">だ</span><span begin="3:35.726" end="3:36.206">つ</span><span begin="3:36.206" end="3:36.347">た</span><span begin="3:36.347" end="3:36.565">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一切都是徒劳——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Subete ga muda datta to</span></p><p begin="3:36.722" end="3:39.603" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:36.722" end="3:37.027">あ</span><span begin="3:37.027" end="3:37.465">あ</span> <span begin="3:37.465" end="3:37.602">相</span><span begin="3:37.602" end="3:37.722">な</span><span begin="3:37.722" end="3:38.008">ら</span><span begin="3:38.008" end="3:38.449">ぬ</span><span begin="3:38.449" end="3:39.070">人</span><span begin="3:39.070" end="3:39.390">生</span><span begin="3:39.390" end="3:39.603">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，事与愿违的人生！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, ai naranu jinsei!</span></p><p begin="3:39.841" end="3:41.929" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:39.841" end="3:40.196">だ</span><span begin="3:40.196" end="3:40.324">か</span><span begin="3:40.324" end="3:40.677">ら</span> <span begin="3:40.677" end="3:41.695">蹲</span><span begin="3:41.695" end="3:41.929">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以蜷缩起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dakara uzukumaru</span></p><p begin="3:42.255" end="3:44.716" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:42.255" end="3:42.420">そ</span><span begin="3:42.420" end="3:42.600">し</span><span begin="3:42.600" end="3:42.953">て</span><span begin="3:42.953" end="3:43.340">全</span><span begin="3:43.340" end="3:43.642">て</span><span begin="3:43.642" end="3:43.802">投</span><span begin="3:43.802" end="3:44.000">げ</span><span begin="3:44.000" end="3:44.461">出</span><span begin="3:44.461" end="3:44.604">す</span><span begin="3:44.604" end="3:44.716">?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后放弃一切？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soshite subete nagedasu?</span></p><p begin="3:44.974" end="3:47.603" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:44.974" end="3:45.139">か</span><span begin="3:45.139" end="3:45.357">く</span><span begin="3:45.357" end="3:45.851">な</span><span begin="3:45.851" end="3:46.278">れ</span><span begin="3:46.278" end="3:46.423">ば</span><span begin="3:46.423" end="3:46.619">お</span><span begin="3:46.619" end="3:47.254">前</span><span begin="3:47.254" end="3:47.380">は</span><span begin="3:47.380" end="3:47.477">も</span><span begin="3:47.477" end="3:47.603">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若是如此你便不过是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kaku nareba omae wa mō</span></p><p begin="3:47.766" end="3:52.258" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:47.766" end="3:47.945">食</span><span begin="3:47.945" end="3:48.163">い</span><span begin="3:48.163" end="3:48.678">で</span><span begin="3:48.678" end="3:49.192">の</span><span begin="3:49.192" end="3:49.337">あ</span><span begin="3:49.337" end="3:49.689">る</span><span begin="3:49.689" end="3:50.217">餌</span><span begin="3:50.217" end="3:50.455">で</span><span begin="3:50.455" end="3:50.760">し</span><span begin="3:50.760" end="3:50.939">か</span><span begin="3:50.939" end="3:51.260">な</span><span begin="3:51.260" end="3:51.565">い</span><span begin="3:51.565" end="3:51.900">…</span><span begin="3:51.900" end="3:52.258">…</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一份可口的饵食而已……</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kuide no aru esa de shika nai……</span></p><p begin="3:50.938" end="3:56.179" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.938" end="3:51.084">あ</span><span begin="3:51.084" end="3:51.336">あ</span><span begin="3:51.336" end="3:51.854">、</span><span begin="3:51.854" end="3:52.086">星</span><span begin="3:52.086" end="3:53.232">を</span><span begin="3:53.232" end="3:53.586">見</span><span begin="3:53.586" end="3:54.396">失</span><span begin="3:54.396" end="3:54.716">う</span><span begin="3:54.716" end="3:54.881">よ</span><span begin="3:54.881" end="3:55.147">う</span><span begin="3:55.147" end="3:55.467">に</span><span begin="3:55.467" end="3:55.860">—</span><span begin="3:55.860" end="3:56.179">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，仿佛再也望不见星辰——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, hoshi wo miusinau yō ni——</span></p><p begin="3:56.514" end="4:00.958" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:56.514" end="3:57.160">だ</span><span begin="3:57.160" end="3:57.917">が</span> <span begin="3:57.917" end="3:58.441">お</span><span begin="3:58.441" end="3:59.076">前</span><span begin="3:59.076" end="3:59.445">の</span><span begin="3:59.445" end="3:59.591">目</span><span begin="3:59.591" end="4:00.958">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但，你的双眸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Daga, omae no me wa</span></p><p begin="4:01.681" end="4:03.181" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.681" end="4:01.850">未</span><span begin="4:01.850" end="4:02.100">だ</span><span begin="4:02.100" end="4:02.366">熾</span><span begin="4:02.366" end="4:02.740">火</span> <span begin="4:02.740" end="4:02.871">そ</span><span begin="4:02.871" end="4:03.016">し</span><span begin="4:03.016" end="4:03.181">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仍是炽火，而且</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mada okibi, soshite</span></p><p begin="4:03.468" end="4:06.845" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:03.468" end="4:03.579">今</span><span begin="4:03.579" end="4:03.764">尚</span><span begin="4:03.764" end="4:04.137">燃</span><span begin="4:04.137" end="4:04.302">え</span><span begin="4:04.302" end="4:04.448">る</span><span begin="4:04.448" end="4:04.613">と</span><span begin="4:04.613" end="4:04.812">き</span><span begin="4:04.812" end="4:05.299">を</span> <span begin="4:05.299" end="4:05.914">待</span><span begin="4:05.914" end="4:06.845">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">至今仍等待着燃烧之刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ima nao moeru toki wo matsu</span></p><p begin="4:07.617" end="4:12.061" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:07.617" end="4:08.237">尽</span><span begin="4:08.237" end="4:08.994">き</span><span begin="4:08.994" end="4:09.603">ぬ</span><span begin="4:09.603" end="4:10.582">怒</span><span begin="4:10.582" end="4:10.727">り</span><span begin="4:10.727" end="4:12.061">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">以不竭的怒火</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsukinu ikari ni</span></p><p begin="4:12.612" end="4:14.955" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.612" end="4:12.774">燃</span><span begin="4:12.774" end="4:12.933">え</span><span begin="4:12.933" end="4:13.098">上</span><span begin="4:13.098" end="4:13.753">が</span><span begin="4:13.753" end="4:14.175">ら</span><span begin="4:14.175" end="4:14.320">せ</span><span begin="4:14.320" end="4:14.955">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">令其熊熊燃烧吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Moeagaraseru</span></p><p begin="4:15.186" end="4:17.571" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:15.186" end="4:15.694">涙</span><span begin="4:15.694" end="4:15.912">の</span><span begin="4:15.912" end="4:16.926">乾</span><span begin="4:16.926" end="4:17.091">い</span><span begin="4:17.091" end="4:17.571">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当泪水干涸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Namida no kawaita</span></p><p begin="4:17.958" end="4:20.788" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:17.958" end="4:18.227">そ</span><span begin="4:18.227" end="4:18.372">の</span><span begin="4:18.372" end="4:18.517">と</span><span begin="4:18.517" end="4:18.701">き</span><span begin="4:18.701" end="4:19.164">に</span><span begin="4:19.164" end="4:19.813">は</span><span begin="4:19.813" end="4:20.421">—</span><span begin="4:20.421" end="4:20.788">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">的那一刻——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono toki ni wa——</span></p><p begin="4:44.523" end="4:47.059" itunes:key="L65" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:44.523" end="4:44.608">&quot;</span><span begin="4:44.608" end="4:44.834">少</span><span begin="4:44.834" end="4:45.004">女</span><span begin="4:45.004" end="4:45.484">&quot;</span><span begin="4:45.484" end="4:45.865">よ</span> <span begin="4:45.865" end="4:46.011">立</span><span begin="4:46.011" end="4:46.232">ち</span><span begin="4:46.232" end="4:46.431">上</span><span begin="4:46.431" end="4:46.839">が</span><span begin="4:46.839" end="4:47.059">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">「少女」啊，站起来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">&quot;Shōjo&quot; yo, tachiagare</span></p><p begin="4:47.458" end="4:49.894" itunes:key="L66" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:47.458" end="4:47.815">空</span><span begin="4:47.815" end="4:48.289">く</span><span begin="4:48.289" end="4:48.691">と</span> <span begin="4:48.691" end="4:48.856">手</span><span begin="4:48.856" end="4:49.070">を</span><span begin="4:49.070" end="4:49.215">伸</span><span begin="4:49.215" end="4:49.642">ば</span><span begin="4:49.642" end="4:49.894">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">向着天空 伸出双手</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aku to te wo nobase</span></p><p begin="4:50.279" end="4:52.541" itunes:key="L67" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:50.279" end="4:51.092">己</span><span begin="4:51.092" end="4:51.502">を</span><span begin="4:51.502" end="4:51.735">害</span><span begin="4:51.735" end="4:52.003">す</span><span begin="4:52.003" end="4:52.410">運</span><span begin="4:52.410" end="4:52.541">命</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">戕害自身的命运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Onore wo gaisu unmei</span></p><p begin="4:53.033" end="4:56.067" itunes:key="L68" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:53.033" end="4:53.164">た</span><span begin="4:53.164" end="4:53.336">だ</span> <span begin="4:53.336" end="4:53.831">強</span><span begin="4:53.831" end="4:54.367">く</span><span begin="4:54.367" end="4:54.745">吠</span><span begin="4:54.745" end="4:55.138">え</span><span begin="4:55.138" end="4:55.754">返</span><span begin="4:55.754" end="4:55.906">せ</span><span begin="4:55.906" end="4:56.067">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只管——放声吼回去！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tada, tsuyoku hoekaese!</span></p><p begin="4:56.104" end="4:58.135" itunes:key="L69" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:56.104" end="4:56.618">そ</span><span begin="4:56.618" end="4:57.005">の</span><span begin="4:57.005" end="4:57.951">物</span><span begin="4:57.951" end="4:58.135">語</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那段物语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono monogatari</span></p><p begin="4:58.499" end="5:00.919" itunes:key="L70" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:58.499" end="4:58.630">そ</span><span begin="4:58.630" end="4:58.795">れ</span><span begin="4:58.795" end="4:59.368">が</span><span begin="4:59.368" end="5:00.279">主</span><span begin="5:00.279" end="5:00.755">人</span><span begin="5:00.755" end="5:00.919">公</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那便是主角</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore ga Purotagonisuta</span></p><p begin="5:01.254" end="5:03.951" itunes:key="L71" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:01.254" end="5:01.327">そ</span><span begin="5:01.327" end="5:01.617">れ</span><span begin="5:01.617" end="5:01.991">こ</span><span begin="5:01.991" end="5:02.136">そ</span><span begin="5:02.136" end="5:02.499">が</span> <span begin="5:02.499" end="5:03.101">誰</span><span begin="5:03.101" end="5:03.561">で</span><span begin="5:03.561" end="5:03.760">も</span><span begin="5:03.760" end="5:03.886">な</span><span begin="5:03.886" end="5:03.951">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那正是——非他人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore koso ga, dare de mo nai</span></p><p begin="5:04.150" end="5:09.335" itunes:key="L72" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:04.150" end="5:04.315">お</span><span begin="5:04.315" end="5:05.004">前</span><span begin="5:05.004" end="5:05.517">の</span><span begin="5:05.517" end="5:05.677">あ</span><span begin="5:05.677" end="5:05.906">る</span> <span begin="5:05.906" end="5:06.770">姿</span><span begin="5:06.770" end="5:07.017">な</span><span begin="5:07.017" end="5:07.274">の</span><span begin="5:07.274" end="5:07.769">だ</span><span begin="5:07.769" end="5:09.083">と</span><span begin="5:09.083" end="5:09.335">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">正是你应有之姿！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Omae no aru sugata na no da to!</span></p><p begin="5:07.242" end="5:12.499" itunes:key="L73" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:07.242" end="5:07.576">あ</span><span begin="5:07.576" end="5:07.888">あ</span><span begin="5:07.888" end="5:08.102">、</span><span begin="5:08.102" end="5:08.244">い</span><span begin="5:08.244" end="5:08.355">つ</span><span begin="5:08.355" end="5:09.498">か</span><span begin="5:09.498" end="5:09.635">み</span><span begin="5:09.635" end="5:09.923">た</span><span begin="5:09.923" end="5:10.337">あ</span><span begin="5:10.337" end="5:10.699">の</span><span begin="5:10.699" end="5:11.084">星</span><span begin="5:11.084" end="5:11.722">は</span><span begin="5:11.722" end="5:12.095">—</span><span begin="5:12.095" end="5:12.373">—</span><span begin="5:12.373" end="5:12.499">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，那曾经仰望的星——！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, itsuka mita ano hoshi wa——!</span></p><p begin="5:12.320" end="5:14.700" itunes:key="L74" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:12.320" end="5:12.557">空</span><span begin="5:12.557" end="5:13.711">よ</span> <span begin="5:13.711" end="5:14.016">星</span><span begin="5:14.016" end="5:14.700">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">苍穹啊，星辰啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora yo, hoshi yo</span></p><p begin="5:14.980" end="5:17.585" itunes:key="L75" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:14.980" end="5:15.072">そ</span><span begin="5:15.072" end="5:15.373">の</span><span begin="5:15.373" end="5:15.504">少</span><span begin="5:15.504" end="5:15.630">女</span><span begin="5:15.630" end="5:15.871">に</span><span begin="5:15.871" end="5:16.022">与</span><span begin="5:16.022" end="5:16.564">え</span><span begin="5:16.564" end="5:16.715">た</span><span begin="5:16.715" end="5:17.103">も</span><span begin="5:17.103" end="5:17.248">う</span><span begin="5:17.248" end="5:17.379">た</span><span begin="5:17.379" end="5:17.539">の</span><span begin="5:17.539" end="5:17.585">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">赐予那少女的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sono ko ni ataeta mouta no wa</span></p><p begin="5:17.801" end="5:20.260" itunes:key="L76" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:17.801" end="5:17.985">そ</span><span begin="5:17.985" end="5:18.131">れ</span><span begin="5:18.131" end="5:19.174">わ</span> <span begin="5:19.174" end="5:19.320">希</span><span begin="5:19.320" end="5:19.481">望</span><span begin="5:19.481" end="5:19.941">—</span><span begin="5:19.941" end="5:20.260">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是——希望——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sore wa kibō——</span></p><p begin="5:20.627" end="5:23.270" itunes:key="L77" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:20.627" end="5:20.948">或</span><span begin="5:20.948" end="5:21.158">い</span><span begin="5:21.158" end="5:21.303">は</span><span begin="5:21.303" end="5:21.562">、</span><span begin="5:21.562" end="5:21.688">呪</span><span begin="5:21.688" end="5:21.974">い</span><span begin="5:21.974" end="5:22.270">の</span><span begin="5:22.270" end="5:22.925">類</span><span begin="5:22.925" end="5:23.051">か</span><span begin="5:23.051" end="5:23.270">？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">亦或是，诅咒之类？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Arui wa, noroi no tagui ka?</span></p><p begin="5:23.352" end="5:25.619" itunes:key="L78" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:23.352" end="5:23.691">あ</span><span begin="5:23.691" end="5:24.743">あ</span> <span begin="5:24.743" end="5:25.150">夜</span><span begin="5:25.150" end="5:25.619">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">啊，在那夜里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa, yoru ni</span></p><p begin="5:26.162" end="5:28.684" itunes:key="L79" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:26.162" end="5:26.502">空</span><span begin="5:26.502" end="5:26.547">高</span><span begin="5:26.547" end="5:27.031">く</span><span begin="5:27.031" end="5:27.178">見</span><span begin="5:27.178" end="5:27.705">上</span><span begin="5:27.705" end="5:27.836">げ</span><span begin="5:27.836" end="5:28.209">た</span><span begin="5:28.209" end="5:28.336">の</span><span begin="5:28.336" end="5:28.480">な</span><span begin="5:28.480" end="5:28.684">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若仰望高远的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sora takaku miageta no nara</span></p><p begin="5:29.026" end="5:30.350" itunes:key="L80" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:29.026" end="5:29.177">そ</span><span begin="5:29.177" end="5:29.322">こ</span><span begin="5:29.322" end="5:30.040">に</span><span begin="5:30.040" end="5:30.170">は</span><span begin="5:30.170" end="5:30.350">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那里——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Soko ni wa—</span></p><p begin="5:30.825" end="5:34.521" itunes:key="L81" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:30.825" end="5:31.150">い</span><span begin="5:31.150" end="5:31.504">つ</span><span begin="5:31.504" end="5:31.878">か</span><span begin="5:31.878" end="5:32.056">の</span> <span begin="5:32.056" end="5:32.549">星</span><span begin="5:32.549" end="5:33.914">が</span><span begin="5:33.914" end="5:34.220">—</span><span begin="5:34.220" end="5:34.521">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有那曾经的星——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsuka no hoshi ga——</span></p><p begin="5:34.983" end="5:40.453" itunes:key="L82" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5:34.983" end="5:35.686">ど</span><span begin="5:35.686" end="5:36.376">う</span><span begin="5:36.376" end="5:36.749">か</span><span begin="5:36.749" end="5:37.069">あ</span><span begin="5:37.069" end="5:37.442">る</span><span begin="5:37.442" end="5:37.602">よ</span><span begin="5:37.602" end="5:37.990">う</span><span begin="5:37.990" end="5:38.194">に</span><span begin="5:38.194" end="5:39.488">と</span><span begin="5:39.488" end="5:39.808">—</span><span begin="5:39.808" end="5:40.128">—</span><span begin="5:40.128" end="5:40.453">—</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">愿它仍在那里———</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Dōka aru yō ni to———</span></p></div></body></tt>